No reasoning supplied. Raw response: {
    "statement": "Emil, your insistence on my honesty feels like a trap! If you were truly a Villager or Mason, wouldn't you already know to trust others who didn’t wake up? But wait—why are you so aggressive? Are you the Seer fabricating urgency to distract from the real threats? Or worse... are you Minion hunting for Werewolf info to protect them? I need you to name your role outright. If you’re a Mason, admit your card. If you’re lying, we all lose! Emil, Selene, Cristina, Semira—this isn’t just about me. This is about who’s here to save us versus who’s here to bury us!"
}

